@title Cross-cabinet run: the Run card names the other cabinet (1920x1080)
@area 3D
# Fixture: the example plus a second enclosure +FLD holding the motor, entry points on both. In the 3D
# view of the cabinet the motor wires end at its entry; the Run card says where the rest is drawn.
open qa/fixtures/cable-cross.novo
wait 20
resize 1920 1080
wait 10
click_text 3D
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text wire runs
wait 4
key Enter
wait 40
shot list
check_layout
click 1665 407
wait 60
shot card-top
expect "other end is in"
scroll 1760 580 -400
wait 10
shot card-foot
